    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/38d709081cec49ce3a6a75b886cfa201.avif?t=1729874920\" width=601 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure with a deep story, challenging puzzles, and thrilling action. Created by a solo developer using Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the year 2026. You are a retired Navy SEAL recruited by Albert, a tech billionaire, with the promise of making you rich, you start the quest to find a cosmic stone that belonged to an ancient civilization, at first it's a simple job but with time it becomes an impossible mission</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/804c6dd262a9cd49d81adb5a85f092de.poster.avif?t=1729874920\" width=508 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/804c6dd262a9cd49d81adb5a85f092de.webm?t=1729874920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/804c6dd262a9cd49d81adb5a85f092de.mp4?t=1729874920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Enigma Awaken&quot; offers a rich and varied gameplay experience:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intriguing Storyline:</strong> Immerse yourself in a deep narrative filled with twists and turns, as you uncover the mysteries of an ancient civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles:</strong> Engage your mind with complex puzzles that require keen observation and clever problem-solving skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Adventure:</strong> Explore diverse environments, from dense jungles and arid deserts to abandoned cities and hidden temples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/4911f8263475d6a854c0dd0b0a32be17.poster.avif?t=1729874920\" width=508 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/4911f8263475d6a854c0dd0b0a32be17.webm?t=1729874920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/4911f8263475d6a854c0dd0b0a32be17.mp4?t=1729874920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Action:</strong> Experience thrilling combat sequences and intense action scenes that will keep your adrenaline pumping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI-Enhanced Development:</strong> Enjoy a game polished with the latest AI tools, ensuring smooth gameplay, realistic environments, and intelligent NPC behaviors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visuals:</strong> Leveraging the power of Unreal Engine 5, &quot;Enigma Awaken&quot; features breathtaking graphics and lifelike animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/192ccb701b7be2b1a9bf72db08f84a24.poster.avif?t=1729874920\" width=508 height=106 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/192ccb701b7be2b1a9bf72db08f84a24.webm?t=1729874920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/192ccb701b7be2b1a9bf72db08f84a24.mp4?t=1729874920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Locations:</strong> Travel across different countries and explore a variety of unique and beautifully crafted settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rich Lore:</strong> Delve into a world filled with rich history and lore, meticulously crafted to enhance the narrative experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo Development: Appreciate the dedication and vision of a single developer, bringing a personal touch to every aspect of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/f6b6735b0978e41fbe5c0036461f28b4.poster.avif?t=1729874920\" width=508 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/f6b6735b0978e41fbe5c0036461f28b4.webm?t=1729874920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/f6b6735b0978e41fbe5c0036461f28b4.mp4?t=1729874920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/38d709081cec49ce3a6a75b886cfa201.avif?t=1729874920\" width=601 height=101 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure with a deep story, challenging puzzles, and thrilling action. Created by a solo developer using Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the year 2026. You are a retired Navy SEAL recruited by Albert, a tech billionaire, with the promise of making you rich, you start the quest to find a cosmic stone that belonged to an ancient civilization, at first it's a simple job but with time it becomes an impossible mission</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/804c6dd262a9cd49d81adb5a85f092de.poster.avif?t=1729874920\" width=508 height=114 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/804c6dd262a9cd49d81adb5a85f092de.webm?t=1729874920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/804c6dd262a9cd49d81adb5a85f092de.mp4?t=1729874920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Enigma Awaken&quot; offers a rich and varied gameplay experience:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intriguing Storyline:</strong> Immerse yourself in a deep narrative filled with twists and turns, as you uncover the mysteries of an ancient civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles:</strong> Engage your mind with complex puzzles that require keen observation and clever problem-solving skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exciting Adventure:</strong> Explore diverse environments, from dense jungles and arid deserts to abandoned cities and hidden temples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/4911f8263475d6a854c0dd0b0a32be17.poster.avif?t=1729874920\" width=508 height=102 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/4911f8263475d6a854c0dd0b0a32be17.webm?t=1729874920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/4911f8263475d6a854c0dd0b0a32be17.mp4?t=1729874920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Action:</strong> Experience thrilling combat sequences and intense action scenes that will keep your adrenaline pumping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI-Enhanced Development:</strong> Enjoy a game polished with the latest AI tools, ensuring smooth gameplay, realistic environments, and intelligent NPC behaviors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visuals:</strong> Leveraging the power of Unreal Engine 5, &quot;Enigma Awaken&quot; features breathtaking graphics and lifelike animations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3030440/extras/192ccb701b7be2b1a9bf72db08f84a24.poster.avif?t=1729874920\" width=508 height=106 ><source src=\"https